### Profile
GET http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer <jwt>

### Update profile
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer <jwt>
Content-Type: application/json

{"nickname":"UC02 refreshed","email":"uc02@example.com"}

### Create default address
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/user/addresses
Authorization: Bearer <jwt>
Content-Type: application/json

{"receiverName":"Demo Receiver","receiverPhone":"13800138000","province":"Guangdong","city":"Shenzhen","detailAddress":"Demo Street","isDefault":1}
